{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00885","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 有所思 · 李白","name":"鼓吹曲辞 有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我思仙人，乃在碧海之东隅。\n海寒多天风，白波连山倒蓬壶。\n长鲸喷涌不可涉，抚心茫茫泪如珠。\n西来青鸟东飞去，愿寄一书谢麻姑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}